  "runtime": {
    "skin": "Retain photographic albedo/normal/roughness maps. Skin tint multiplies the albedo; keep roughness factor1 when a roughnessMap exists instead of multiplying it again by .58.",
    "cloth": "Keep woven normal map when replacing kit albedo.",
    "animation": "Crossfade 120\u2013200ms. Locomotion timeScale = world speed / (nominal speed * heightCm/180). Use explicit left-foot variants; kit text is never mirrored. Match simulation owns the ball; contact markers align presentation.",
    "footPlanting": "Analytical two-bone stance samples authored at30Hz, no IK runtime required. Blend stride speed to movement; a runtime terrain IK pass is still needed for uneven terrain.",
    "leftFoot": "Use receive_left/pass_left/shoot_left/cross_left/penalty_left/tackle_left/slide_left. These mirror paired bone poses; kit text and mesh geometry are not reflected.",
